    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d195">

                <pb facs="0309" n="297" sameAs="frus:frus1937v01/pg297"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.00/5438: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Counselor of Embassy in Spain</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Thurston</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Valencia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-05-15T17:00:00-04:30">May 15, 1937—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 9:40 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>630. My 628 and 629.<anchor n="86" xml:id="d195-f1"/> I have just received
                    confirmation at the Foreign Office of the resignation of the entire Cabinet.
                    Reports from other sources say that Largo Caballero has been requested to form a
                    new Ministry. The city in general is unaware of it and is quiet.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Ambassador Bowers and Embassy at Paris.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thurston</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d195-f1" n="86" xml:id="d195-f1-content">
                <p>Neither telegram printed.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
